sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Gateway A (owner of group 1)
  participant M as mon: NVMeofGwMon
  participant B as Gateway B
  participant O as OSDMonitor
  participant H as Host
  A--xM: beacons stopped
  Note over M: after mon_nvmeofgw_beacon_grace (7 seconds)<br/>A ⇒ UNAVAILABLE
  M->>M: find_failover_candidate: least-loaded gateway in the same location
  M->>O: blocklist A's addresses
  M->>B: map: group 1 = WAIT_BLOCKLIST_CMPL (30-second timer)
  O-->>B: OSDMap with epoch ≥ the blocklist epoch
  B->>M: beacon with the new osd_epoch
  M->>B: group 1 = ACTIVE
  B->>H: ANA change: path B optimized for group 1
  H->>B: I/O resumes
